  "zip_caveats": "Denver ZIPs that cross into other counties: 80212 and 80214 (Wheat Ridge, Edgewater, Lakewood in Jefferson County), 80221 (mostly unincorporated Adams County and Westminster), 80226 and 80227 (Lakewood), 80222 and 80224 (Glendale and unincorporated Arapahoe), 80231 and 80247 (Aurora and Arapahoe County), 80110 and 80113 (Englewood, Sheridan, Cherry Hills), 80235 (Lakewood and unincorporated Jeffco), 80123 and 80236 (Bow Mar, Littleton area). Glendale (80246) is a separate city inside Denver's footprint and votes an Arapahoe County ballot. Within Denver, your State House, State Senate, RTD and (for a sliver of northeast Denver) congressional district depend on your address; use the Secretary of State lookup or your mailed ballot.",
